@startuml process
!include style.iuml
title LazyFinance — Process View\nOne request-bound path at a time
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #D5E8D4
  BorderColor #64748B
  BorderThickness 2
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F5F9FA
  DiamondBorderColor #64748B
  FontSize 13
}

start
:Explicit browser / MCP request; <<#DAE8FC>>
:API verifies credentials / scopes\nand resolves the trusted owner; <<#FFF2CC>>

switch (Request path)
case (Financial read)
  :Persistence: scoped factual\nprojection / aggregate; <<#FFE6CC>>
  :API: financial interpretation,\ncalendar rules and response; <<#D5E8D4>>
case (Assistant turn)
  :Persistence: claim\nnonce, lease and history; <<#FFE6CC>>
  if (New turn acquired?) then (yes)
    :API: bounded model / tool loop outside SQL,\nowned reads / proposals use separate scoped RPCs; <<#E1D5E7>>
    :Persistence: lease-checked\nturn completion; <<#FFE6CC>>
  else (replay)
    :Return saved / pending turn,\ndo not run the model again; <<#DAE8FC>>
  endif
case (Approved / delegated action)
  :Saved-version UI approval OR\nseparately granted MCP write scopes; <<#FFF2CC>>
  :Short owner-locked transaction:\nrecheck authority, facts and idempotency; <<#FFE6CC>>
  :Domain command + receipt commit together,\nstale input changes no finance; <<#FFE6CC>>
case (Bank synchronization)
  :Persistence: acquire\nrevision-bound lease / honor backoff; <<#FFE6CC>>
  if (Lease acquired?) then (yes)
    :API: bounded provider fetch\noutside SQL; <<#F8CECC>>
    if (Valid available snapshot?) then (yes)
      :Persistence: consistent owned facts; <<#FFE6CC>>
      :API: normalize and prepare\noutside SQL; <<#D5E8D4>>
      :Atomic commit rechecks revision / fingerprint,\nsaves facts, decisions and checkpoint; <<#FFE6CC>>
    else (failure)
      :Record failure against current revision,\nretain last-good facts / checkpoint; <<#FFE6CC>>
    endif
  else (active / backoff)
    :Return existing state,\ndo not start another fetch; <<#DAE8FC>>
  endif
endswitch

:Return confirmed state,\nsaved result or explicit uncertainty; <<#DAE8FC>>
note right
  Uncertain write response → read status.
  Never automatically replay a mutation.
  Stop / disconnect does not prove rollback.
end note
stop

legend bottom
  Representative financial paths, not an exhaustive router inventory.
  All user writes share a short per-owner advisory lock.
  Leases coalesce request-driven work; there is no scheduler or worker queue.
  Model / provider calls and financial preparation never run inside SQL.
  Focused message sequences are documented separately.
endlegend
@enduml
